friends if ordered (because they were ordered to do exactly that).<br /> <br /> Space Marines, barring rare exceptions individually and as chapters (Lamenters, Salamanders), are indoctrinated child soldiers who are made psychologically incapable of questioning their mission. Wherever possible, angst is <i>engineered out</i> of their brains. (Some angst about specific things, like the Blood Angels, with their blood thirst and eventual slide into indiscriminate, permanent homicidal rage). By and large, Space Marines are designed as weapons to protect/further the interests of the Imperium as an institution.<br /> <br /> <br /> At least with Garou, who are similarly meant to be Gaia's living weapons, they're fighting against the ruin and death of life itself. Rather than to prop up a fascist state.</div> </div> </div> </div>That wouldn't convince a person who really doesn't like that context.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-28T08:44:47-08:00","id":1529598,"title":"","content":"I should probably note I don't think anyone can also do Werewolf (or any WOD product) &quot;wrong&quot; either since every Storyteller likes to emphasize different elements at their table. My W:TA is very much still a Gothic Punk one that is about the futility of a forever war that will eventually wear down the soul. My inspiration for Werewolf isn't Vampire, though, but Highlander. The Werewolves are noble souls up against pure evil but the conflict is one that destroys even the strongest spirits.<br /> <br /> That and my Albrecht is Connor Macleod.<br /> <br /> However, Heavy Arms may do it very differently and no one is going to tell him he's doing it wrong. Least of all me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-28T08:45:01-08:00","id":1529599,"title":"","content":"So, as a concept I like the Cult of Fenris. The name, Hauglosk and the Get aside, they have potential as deuteroantagonists.<br /> <br /> A political movement that seeks to offer an alternative to the nation and seeks extreme measures and solutions. Members would come from all the tribes and strata of Rank. They should not be recruiting through torture and insanity but through offering quick and loud results. They should be a threat because their morals will lead the Garou away from the ideals they represent and need to advocate to have any chance to get the humans on their side before the end.<br /> <br /> Such a front could be a terrifying foe, for their message is strong and enticing. And also one that is bound to destroy themselves in a horrible, horrible end, but not before it makes many Garou lose their way.<br /> <br /> That's not the organization that was made in W5, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7},{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-29T05:12:25-08:00","id":1529638,"title":"","content":"y'know,it occurs to me that w5 only it has 1 book to go on now. just 1. Many games started badly on its first book and became quite beloved with the next ones,maybe w5 just needs times to grow.<br /> (this is not meant to disregard,or even disagree with anyone's criticisms. it's meant to insert some positivity here)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-29T08:30:50-08:00","id":1529643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1524711-review-of-w5?p=1529598#post1529598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I should probably note I don't think anyone can also do Werewolf (or any WOD product) &quot;wrong&quot; either since every Storyteller likes to emphasize different elements at their table. My W:TA is very much still a Gothic Punk one that is about the futility of a forever war that will eventually wear down the soul. My inspiration for Werewolf isn't Vampire, though, but Highlander. The Werewolves are noble souls up against pure evil but the conflict is one that destroys even the strongest spirits.<br /> <br /> That and my Albrecht is Connor Macleod.<br /> <br /> However, Heavy Arms may do it very differently and no one is going to tell him he's doing it wrong. Least of all me.</div> </div> </div> </div>You don't need to call out a user when I've specifically requested people avoid aggression, passive or otherwise. Please leave this thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}